### Catálogo de procedimentos do hospital
### Todos os endpoints exigem token de um usuário com role HOSPITAL.
### O hospital é derivado do token; não é enviado no corpo nem na URL.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@procedureId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@doctorId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Login como gestor de hospital (obtenha o accessToken aqui)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/hospital/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hospital@tcc.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("hospitalToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 2. Cadastrar procedimento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "title": "Cirurgia de joelho",
  "description": "Artroplastia total de joelho",
  "estimatedDuration": 120,
  "active": true
}

### 3. Cadastrar segundo procedimento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "title": "Cirurgia de mão",
  "description": "Correção de túnel do carpo",
  "estimatedDuration": 60
}

### 4. Listar procedimentos ativos (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures?page=0&size=10&sort=title,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### 5. Listar incluindo procedimentos inativos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### 6. Buscar procedimento por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/{{procedureId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### 7. Atualizar procedimento
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/{{procedureId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "title": "Cirurgia de joelho",
  "description": "Artroplastia total de joelho - revisada",
  "estimatedDuration": 150,
  "active": true
}

### 8. Inativar procedimento (soft delete, o registro é mantido)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/{{procedureId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### 9. Atrelar médico ao procedimento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/{{procedureId}}/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}"
}

### 10. Listar médicos autorizados no procedimento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/{{procedureId}}/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### 11. Desatrelar médico do procedimento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/{{procedureId}}/doctors/{{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### --- Cenários de erro ---

### 12. Título duplicado no mesmo hospital -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "title": "Cirurgia de joelho",
  "estimatedDuration": 120
}

### 13. Título em branco -> 400 (validação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "title": "",
  "estimatedDuration": 120
}

### 14. Duração negativa -> 400 (validação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

{
  "title": "Procedimento inválido",
  "estimatedDuration": -10
}

### 15. Procedimento de outro hospital -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{hospitalToken}}

### 16. Sem token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures

### 17. Token de médico em rota de hospital -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/doctor/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@tcc.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("doctorToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospital/procedures
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
